    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1966-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The new area is \\(1.1\\cdot0.9=0.99\\) times the old area. It is therefore \\(1\\%\\) smaller.\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
